{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 0, "to": 4800}, "text": " And all my viewers in the United States of America, from Jolton, in Tennessee."}, {"offsets": {"from": 4800, "to": 7300}, "text": " Let's open this sucker up and see what we've got."}, {"offsets": {"from": 7300, "to": 15300}, "text": " Oh yes, it's from Unmanaged615, who is a huge contributor to the Amp Hour."}, {"offsets": {"from": 15300, "to": 20799}, "text": " If you don't know the Amp Hour, I've only been doing a radio show for like 13 years or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 20799, "to": 23799}, "text": " Theamphour.com, with Chris Gammel, of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 24100, "to": 28100}, "text": " And he updates, adds stuff to the Reddit,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 28100, "to": 33599}, "text": " because there's a Reddit where you can put show suggestions for stuff for us to talk about on the podcast."}, {"offsets": {"from": 33599, "to": 36599}, "text": " So, Unmanaged615, thank you very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 36599, "to": 39099}, "text": " And what have we got here?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 41099, "to": 43099}, "text": " What are we? Oh, is that a panel meter?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 43099, "to": 45599}, "text": " It's a panel meter. Oh, it's Simpson."}, {"offsets": {"from": 45599, "to": 48599}, "text": " Simpson DC Volt panel meter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 48599, "to": 50099}, "text": " Wow!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 50099, "to": 52599}, "text": " Okay, let's do a quick two-minute teardown."}, {"offsets": {"from": 52900, "to": 54900}, "text": " Maybe we can power it up, maybe it still works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 54900, "to": 59900}, "text": " Wow, I didn't know Simpson did panel meters. That's interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 59900, "to": 66400}, "text": " Model 2850, 2 volt range, comes in all different types, current and voltage as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 66400, "to": 71400}, "text": " 120 volts AC, so, yeah, I've got to power it up from the mains."}, {"offsets": {"from": 71400, "to": 74900}, "text": " Hoping I can just power it up from a PSU."}, {"offsets": {"from": 74900, "to": 77400}, "text": " But, yeah, card edge, jobby."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77400, "to": 80400}, "text": " So it slides into, you know, something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 80699, "to": 83199}, "text": " And I think I can see 3.5 digit in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 83199, "to": 84199}, "text": " See if it still works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 84199, "to": 87699}, "text": " And we're talking 1976 vintage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 87699, "to": 89199}, "text": " Check that out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 89199, "to": 90699}, "text": " Fantastic!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 90699, "to": 91699}, "text": " Aha!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 91699, "to": 93699}, "text": " Look at the discreet trainees down there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 93699, "to": 94699}, "text": " Look at them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 94699, "to": 96699}, "text": " Look at them. Little tripods."}, {"offsets": {"from": 96699, "to": 97699}, "text": " Woo!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 97699, "to": 98699}, "text": " Very nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 98699, "to": 99699}, "text": " Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 99699, "to": 102199}, "text": " Oh, you don't see construction like that anymore."}, {"offsets": {"from": 102199, "to": 103699}, "text": " When I was a boy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 103699, "to": 106199}, "text": " So we've got mains in here, but check this out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 106199, "to": 108199}, "text": " Like, I would have thought, oh, yeah, here and here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 108199, "to": 109199}, "text": " Hook up the mains."}, {"offsets": {"from": 109500, "to": 111500}, "text": " But that trace goes through there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 111500, "to": 113500}, "text": " And it's connected onto the gate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 113500, "to": 117500}, "text": " It's like inside one of the laminates there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 117500, "to": 118500}, "text": " What?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 118500, "to": 119500}, "text": " What?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 119500, "to": 121500}, "text": " Ha ha ha!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 121500, "to": 123500}, "text": " So I said that's an earth."}, {"offsets": {"from": 123500, "to": 127500}, "text": " And then, of course, one goes in here through a fuse over to here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 127500, "to": 130500}, "text": " But there's a couple of more mains wiring."}, {"offsets": {"from": 130500, "to": 133500}, "text": " So it must be this one and the other one on the other side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 133500, "to": 135500}, "text": " And that goes over to here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135500, "to": 137500}, "text": " And there's, so this is the primary side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 137500, "to": 138500}, "text": " This is the secondary side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138800, "to": 140800}, "text": " And they've got a tap off here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 140800, "to": 144800}, "text": " Like, going to one pin."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144800, "to": 146800}, "text": " There's like a shorted."}, {"offsets": {"from": 146800, "to": 148800}, "text": " Is that like a shorted turn?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 148800, "to": 150800}, "text": " Or is that some sort of voltage?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 150800, "to": 152800}, "text": " Oh, that might be voltage selection, perhaps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 152800, "to": 154800}, "text": " Let's have a look at the displays on this thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 154800, "to": 158800}, "text": " Can we get a manufacturer end part number there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 158800, "to": 161800}, "text": " That looks interesting. Wow!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 161800, "to": 164800}, "text": " I don't think I've seen one of those before."}, {"offsets": {"from": 164800, "to": 166800}, "text": " It's got dual digit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 167100, "to": 169100}, "text": " One's a half digit with the plus minus."}, {"offsets": {"from": 169100, "to": 171100}, "text": " But wow, that's neat."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171100, "to": 173100}, "text": " What is that display?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 173100, "to": 175100}, "text": " I need a part number on that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 175100, "to": 177100}, "text": " Oh, look, we can take it out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 177100, "to": 179100}, "text": " Is that like a socketed?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 179100, "to": 181100}, "text": " In fact, I don't know those numbers there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 181100, "to": 185100}, "text": " But are they seven segment decoders?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 185100, "to": 187100}, "text": " They had four layer boards back then."}, {"offsets": {"from": 187100, "to": 191100}, "text": " They just, ribbon cable routed that bus all the way over."}, {"offsets": {"from": 191100, "to": 193100}, "text": " There you go. So that's obviously like the seven segment input."}, {"offsets": {"from": 193100, "to": 196100}, "text": " So this looks like it could be the decoder, perhaps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 196399, "to": 200399}, "text": " And then you've got sync transistors for each segment in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 200399, "to": 202399}, "text": " Plus the decimal points."}, {"offsets": {"from": 202399, "to": 204399}, "text": " Oh, here you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 204399, "to": 206399}, "text": " Could be taken on Fran Lab here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 206399, "to": 208399}, "text": " For unusual displays."}, {"offsets": {"from": 208399, "to": 210399}, "text": " There's a little nipple on it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 210399, "to": 214399}, "text": " Which seals the glass."}, {"offsets": {"from": 214399, "to": 220399}, "text": " So it's some sort of vacuum-y type fluorescent-y display."}, {"offsets": {"from": 220399, "to": 224399}, "text": " So this is a Beckman SP351."}, {"offsets": {"from": 224699, "to": 226699}, "text": " It's called a panoplex display."}, {"offsets": {"from": 226699, "to": 228699}, "text": " And it looks a gorgeous orange."}, {"offsets": {"from": 228699, "to": 230699}, "text": " I've seen a photo of it lit up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230699, "to": 232699}, "text": " Yeah, Fran Lab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 232699, "to": 234699}, "text": " Eat your heart out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 234699, "to": 236699}, "text": " I wonder if it still works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 236699, "to": 238699}, "text": " And that's a matching Beckman socket too."}, {"offsets": {"from": 238699, "to": 240699}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240699, "to": 242699}, "text": " And yeah, this one's a different part number."}, {"offsets": {"from": 242699, "to": 244699}, "text": " Because it is physically a different part."}, {"offsets": {"from": 244699, "to": 246699}, "text": " It's got two seven segment displays"}, {"offsets": {"from": 246699, "to": 248699}, "text": " instead of the one and a half digit on the other one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 248699, "to": 250699}, "text": " But alright."}, {"offsets": {"from": 250699, "to": 252699}, "text": " Very nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 255000}, "text": " Okay, one weird-ass Yankee plug."}, {"offsets": {"from": 255000, "to": 257000}, "text": " And 263 primary."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 259000}, "text": " That sounds okie-dokie."}, {"offsets": {"from": 259000, "to": 261000}, "text": " Let's do a smoke test."}, {"offsets": {"from": 261000, "to": 263000}, "text": " Okay, let's see if this powers up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 263000, "to": 265000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 265000, "to": 267000}, "text": " Let's switch this on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 267000, "to": 269000}, "text": " Switch the mains on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 269000, "to": 271000}, "text": " Fingers crossed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 271000, "to": 273000}, "text": " Oh yes, look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 273000, "to": 275000}, "text": " Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 275000, "to": 277000}, "text": " Look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 277000, "to": 279000}, "text": " That display is gorgeous."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 281000}, "text": " Look at that orange."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281299, "to": 283299}, "text": " Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 283299, "to": 285299}, "text": " I'll turn the lights off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 285299, "to": 287299}, "text": " Look at that gorgeous glow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 287299, "to": 289299}, "text": " Wow. Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 289299, "to": 291299}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 291299, "to": 293299}, "text": " A Beckman Panaflex display."}, {"offsets": {"from": 293299, "to": 295299}, "text": " Fran Lab, eat your heart out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295299, "to": 297299}, "text": " Unless, of course, she's already beat me to it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 297299, "to": 299299}, "text": " So I'll change the exposure here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 299299, "to": 301299}, "text": " And"}, {"offsets": {"from": 301299, "to": 303299}, "text": " oh, look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 303299, "to": 305299}, "text": " The thing of beauty"}, {"offsets": {"from": 305299, "to": 307299}, "text": " is joy forever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 307299, "to": 309299}, "text": " Look at that. Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 309600, "to": 311600}, "text": " Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 315600, "to": 317600}, "text": " So thank you very much, Unmanaged."}, {"offsets": {"from": 317600, "to": 319600}, "text": " That is just gorgeous."}, {"offsets": {"from": 319600, "to": 321600}, "text": " A Simpson"}, {"offsets": {"from": 321600, "to": 323600}, "text": " panel meter with"}, {"offsets": {"from": 323600, "to": 325600}, "text": " Beckman Panaflex"}, {"offsets": {"from": 325600, "to": 327600}, "text": " display."}, {"offsets": {"from": 327600, "to": 329600}, "text": " I hope that"}, {"offsets": {"from": 329600, "to": 331600}, "text": " my camera is color-balanced,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 331600, "to": 333600}, "text": " so I'm hoping that orange will"}, {"offsets": {"from": 333600, "to": 335600}, "text": " come out. The camcorder screen doesn't look"}, {"offsets": {"from": 335600, "to": 337600}, "text": " as orange as in real life, but"}, {"offsets": {"from": 337899, "to": 339899}, "text": " trust me, that's beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 339899, "to": 341899}, "text": " Apparently these are called neon"}, {"offsets": {"from": 341899, "to": 343899}, "text": " planar displays, and I found a"}, {"offsets": {"from": 343899, "to": 345899}, "text": " UK website which specializes"}, {"offsets": {"from": 345899, "to": 347899}, "text": " in these displays. So I'll link it"}, {"offsets": {"from": 347899, "to": 349899}, "text": " down below, and they've like"}, {"offsets": {"from": 349899, "to": 351899}, "text": " documented all these things, and they have"}, {"offsets": {"from": 351899, "to": 353899}, "text": " gorgeous photos, and they've got completed"}, {"offsets": {"from": 353899, "to": 355899}, "text": " clocks with these things. It looks like they made them"}, {"offsets": {"from": 355899, "to": 357899}, "text": " in all different shapes and sizes, and"}, {"offsets": {"from": 357899, "to": 359899}, "text": " these were made by at least"}, {"offsets": {"from": 359899, "to": 361899}, "text": " three different companies. These"}, {"offsets": {"from": 361899, "to": 363899}, "text": " Panaflex was like"}, {"offsets": {"from": 363899, "to": 365899}, "text": " a Beckman trademark"}, {"offsets": {"from": 366200, "to": 368200}, "text": " or whatever, but yeah,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 368200, "to": 370200}, "text": " it's interesting. There is a whole bunch"}, {"offsets": {"from": 370200, "to": 372200}, "text": " of info out there on these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 372200, "to": 374200}, "text": " Anyway, these are gorgeous."}, {"offsets": {"from": 374200, "to": 376200}, "text": " Are they not?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 376200, "to": 378200}, "text": " Wow, look at this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 378200, "to": 380200}, "text": " Thank you very much, Unmanaged,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 380200, "to": 382200}, "text": " for sending this in. This is fantastic."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}